# Git-only server deploy (xboard-api)

**Never copy PHP/Laravel source to production with `scp`, `rsync`, or manual file paste.**

## Correct workflow

1. Commit on `main`.
2. `git push origin main`
3. On `server@xdexboard.com`:
   ```bash
   bash /var/www/xboard-api/scripts/server-git-pull-xboard-api.sh
   ```

The script checks out `origin/main`, runs `composer install`, `migrate --force`, config/route cache.

## Forbidden

- `scp app/… server@…:/var/www/xboard-api/…`
- Patching controllers/services on the server outside git
- Deploy “fixes” without push + pull

## Verify after deploy

```bash
cd /var/www/xboard-api && git rev-parse --short HEAD && git status --short
```

HEAD must match the pushed commit; working tree must be **clean**.
